# so a GitHub source archive of the superproject contains no Liberty at all.
# Pin the five RVT/TT NLDM families published by the official OpenROAD flow
# instead.  //tech/asap7 merges them into one Liberty because both Yosys ABC
# mapping and LiveHD's pass.abc accept one library file.
